WEBVTT

00:00:00.647 --> 00:00:02.580
A run counts fal's jobs.

00:00:02.788 --> 00:00:04.820
Each is priced before it's sent,

00:00:05.188 --> 00:00:07.220
then held under the run's spend cap.

00:00:07.473 --> 00:00:09.540
Agent Run, beta fifty two.

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:14.580
The price is fal's list price times the units the job states.

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:18.420
A job the cap can't take is refused unsent.

00:00:19.228 --> 00:00:20.420
Priced before it's sent.

00:00:20.630 --> 00:00:22.900
Upgrade with the install line.
